### Gateway health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health
x-correlation-id: demo-health-001

### Order service readiness (direct/internal)
GET http://localhost:3001/health/ready

### Create order through Gateway
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
x-correlation-id: demo-order-001

{
  "customerId": "CUS-1001",
  "priority": "EXPRESS",
  "pickup": {
    "label": "North Warehouse",
    "address": "Av. Example 100",
    "latitude": -0.164,
    "longitude": -78.472
  },
  "dropoff": {
    "label": "Customer",
    "address": "Calle Example 200",
    "latitude": -0.189,
    "longitude": -78.487
  }
}

### List orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders

### Replace ORDER_ID after creating an order
@orderId = ORDER_ID

### Get order
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}

### Cancel order
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
